    <p class="reveal" style="margin-top:24px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;opacity:0.6;max-width:32ch">The cloth tells us how it wants to fall. Walnut tables, blackened steel shears, brown kraft that has seen a thousand drafts. No mood boards. The material is the brief.</p>
